                        <efac:ChangeReason>
                            <cbc:ReasonCode listName="change-corrig-justification">cancel-intent</cbc:ReasonCode>
                            <efbc:ReasonDescription languageID="ENG">Following a comprehensive internal review of the tender requirements and specifications, it has been identified that certain critical logistical elements—specifically relating to the cost and operational dynamics of the consolidation point, including storage and transportation of Exhibitors' point-of-sale materials—were inadvertently omitted from the original scope.

This omission has resulted in an uneven basis for comparison among supplier submissions, particularly in the logistics pricing component, which is essential to ensuring a fair and accurate evaluation.
As such, the current tender does not fully reflect our operational needs over the term of the contract. To ensure transparency, fairness, and alignment with our strategic objectives, we have decided to terminate the current tender process and initiate a revised competition that incorporates these essential requirements.

We will proceed to cancel this CFT in the coming days and re-issue an amended version as soon as possible. We appreciate the time and work that has gone into your submission to date, and hope that you will consider re-submitting under the revised specifications.
</efbc:ReasonDescription>
                        </efac:ChangeReason>
                    </efac:Changes>
